38. [...] X [...]
#lem: X; X; X
#tr.en: …… raised his head high. 
#etcsl: line-id=38

39. [...] saŋ# an-še₃ mi-[X-il₂]
#lem: X; saŋ[head]; an[sky]; il[raise]
#tr.en: …… before him …… rejoiced at him. 
#etcsl: line-id=39

40. [...] igi-ni-še₃ X [...]
#lem: X; igi[eye]; X; X
#tr.en: …… embraced him. Your …… has determined the destiny. 
#etcsl: line-id=40

41. [...] mu-un-na-e-hul₂-hul₂ [...]
#lem: X; hul[rejoice]; X
#tr.en: May you be their ……, exercising lordship over them. 
#etcsl: line-id=41

42. [...] gu₂-da mu-ni-in#-[la₂] X
#lem: X; gu[neck]; la[hang]; X
#tr.en: May …… which has been bestowed on you never cease. 
#etcsl: line-id=42

43. X [...] X-da-zu nam mu-ni-ib₂-tar# X
#lem: X; X; X; nam[fate]; tar[cut]; X
#tr.en: You are well-suited for ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=43

44. X [...] X-da-bi he₂-me-en nam-nun-bi ak-[de₃]
#lem: X; X; X; me[be]; namnun[magnificence]; ak[do]
#tr.en: and may its time be prolonged for you. 
#etcsl: line-id=44

45. [X X] saŋ#-e-eš mi-ni-in-rig₇-ga-zu muš₃ nam-[ba-tum₂-mu]
#lem: X; X; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]; muš[face]; tum[bring]
#tr.en: A destiny has been determined for you and you have been called by name; 
#etcsl: line-id=45

46. [...] X GI ši-bi₂-du₇ ud-bi ha-ra-su₃-[ud-de₃]
#lem: X; X; X; du[perfect]; ud[sun]; sud[distant]
#tr.en: may you have no rival! 
#etcsl: line-id=46

47. nam tar-ra mu sa₄-a-<<mu>>-me-en gaba gi na-an-[X-tuku]
#lem: nam[fate]; tar[cut]; mu[name]; še[call by name]; gaba[breast]; gi[turn]; tuku[acquire]
#etcsl: line-id=47







